#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:122
msgid "Throttle Based"
msgstr "使用动态谐波陷波滤波器管理陀螺仪噪声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:122
msgid "RPM Sensor"
msgstr ""
"多旋翼飞行器的陀螺仪噪声主要来源于电机振动。由于电机转速随油门变化，振动频率也随之变化，因此固定频率的陷波滤波器效果有限。动态谐波陷波滤波器可以实时追踪噪声频率，提供更有效的滤波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:122
msgid "ESC Telemetry"
msgstr "动态谐波陷波滤波器通过以下方式追踪噪声频率："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:122
msgid "In-Flight FFT"
msgstr ""
"油门位置（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = "
"1）：根据油门量估算电机转速，进而估算噪声频率。适用于大多数多旋翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:122
msgid "Traditional Heli Notch Filter Setup"
msgstr ""
"ESC 遥测（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 3）：从 ESC 获取实际电机 RPM "
"数据，提供最准确的频率追踪。需要 BLHeli 系列 ESC 并正确配置遥测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:7
#: 10d1f668ca074986a5de60e41bffc6ae
msgid "Managing Gyro Noise with the Dynamic Harmonic Notch Filters"
msgstr ""
"飞行中 FFT（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 4）：通过实时 FFT "
"分析陀螺仪数据，直接识别主要噪声频率。最为灵活，适用于各种机型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:9
#: 81dc8491e166404f9f5946614525e06f
msgid ""
"As discussed under the :ref:`Vibration Damping<common-vibration-damping>` "
"topic, managing vibration in ArduPilot autopilot installations is extremely "
"important in order to yield predictable control of an aircraft. Typically "
"installations utilize mechanical vibration damping for the autopilot, "
"internally or externally, in order to remove the worst of the vibration. "
"However, mechanical damping can only go so far and software filtering must "
"be used to remove further noise."
msgstr ""
"RPM 传感器（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<common-vibration-damping>` = 2 或 5）：使用外部 RPM "
"传感器直接测量旋翼转速。主要用于传统直升机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:11
#: c2d90f1be2c946408b7d3a25bbb469b0
msgid ""
"To the autopilot, vibration noise looks like any other disturbance (e.g. "
"wind, turbulence, control link slop, etc.) that the autopilot must "
"compensate for in order to control the aircraft. This prevents optimum "
"tuning of the attitude control loops and decreased performance."
msgstr "对于基于陀螺仪的速率控制器，过高的低通滤波截止频率会导致噪声传递到控制输出，引起电机发热和抖动，甚至影响飞行稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:13
#: cbea7d13f37b415fb4d9c763473d967c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides two filtering mechanisms for noise. Lowpass filters on "
"the accelerometer signals, controlled by the "
":ref:`INS_ACCEL_FILTER<INS_ACCEL_FILTER>`, and  the gyro signals, controlled"
" by :ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>`, and Harmonic Notch Filters on "
"the gyro signals."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 为噪声提供两类滤波机制：作用于加速度计信号的低通滤波器（由 "
":ref:`INS_ACCEL_FILTER<INS_ACCEL_FILTER>` 控制）和作用于陀螺仪信号的低通滤波器（由 "
":ref:`INS_GYRO_FILTER<INS_GYRO_FILTER>` 控制），以及作用于陀螺仪信号的谐波陷波滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:15
#: 8879f211c787425b9cb603ffb2cd136a
msgid ""
"As discussed in :ref:`common-measuring-vibration` section, there are "
"basically two classes of noise/vibrations: those generated within the "
"bandwidth of the gyros/accelerometer sampling and noise above those "
"frequencies which are \"aliased\" down to within that bandwidth and can "
"cause the \"leans\". The aliased noise must be eliminated at the source with"
" improved mounting or frame rigidity, but the above filters can deal with "
"the other sources, typically generated from the motor/propellers at their "
"rotation frequency and its harmonics."
msgstr ""
"如 :ref:`common-measuring-vibration` "
"一节所述，噪声/震动基本分为两类：产生于陀螺仪/加速度计采样带宽之内的噪声，以及高于这些频率、被\"混叠\"折回带宽之内并可能导致\"倾斜漂移\"的噪声。混叠噪声必须通过改进减振安装或提高机架刚性在源头消除；而上述滤波器可以对付其余来源——通常是电机/螺旋桨在其旋转频率及其谐波处产生的噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:17
#: 06f17846cbcb4ddcaa9a072ad168e9fe
msgid ""
"For multicopters and QuadPlanes, virtually all vibrations originate from the"
" motor's rotational frequency.  For helicopters and planes, the vibrations "
"are linked to the main rotor/prop speed."
msgstr ""
"对于基于陀螺仪的速率控制器，陀螺仪低通滤波器截止频率（``ATC_RAT_RLL_FLTT``、``ATC_RAT_PIT_FLTT``、``ATC_RAT_YAW_FLTT``"
" "
"等）越低，对快速干扰的响应能力越差；截止频率越高，传入的噪声和震动越多，实际上会抵消增益的提升。启用一个或两个谐波陷波滤波器，可以针对性地滤除电机产生的噪声，从而允许将低通滤波器的截止频率设置得更高，进而实现更紧致的调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:19
#: 4387b6242bad45d0bb4f78ccab947810
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has support for two notch filters whose filter frequency can be "
"linked to the motor rotational frequency for motors, or the rotor speed for "
"helicopters, and provides notches at a primary frequency and its harmonics."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持两个陷波滤波器，其滤波频率可关联到电机的旋转频率（直升机则为旋翼转速），并在基频及其谐波处提供陷波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:21
#: a10c889655f344028633d30c2d7e54a3
msgid ""
"While the lowpass filters can effectively diminish the impact of this noise,"
" having low frequency set points creates a lot of phase lag and therefore "
"reduces how aggressive the tune can be before oscillation occurs, which "
"results in a poorer tune."
msgstr "选择陷波中心频率的控制方式。请参阅 :ref:`center_freq_control`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:23
#: c8e99bf01135446fada2bd482ab2f320
msgid ""
"For the gyro based rate controllers, this reduces their ability to respond "
"to fast disturbances. If the gyro lowpass filter can be set higher, the "
"phase lag induced is lower and the tune can be more aggressive. But this "
"allows more noise and vibration, effectively canceling that gain out. "
"Enabling either one or both of the Harmonic Notch filters gives the ability "
"to target the noise generated by the motors, allowing a higher frequency of "
"the following low pass to be set and therefore allowing tighter tune."
msgstr ""
"对于基于陀螺仪的速率控制器，这会降低其对快速干扰的响应能力。如果陀螺仪低通滤波器的截止频率可以设置得更高，则引入的相位延迟会更小，调参也可以更激进。但这样会允许更多噪声和震动进入，实际上会抵消增益的提升。启用一个或两个谐波陷波滤波器，可以针对性地滤除电机产生的噪声，从而允许将低通滤波器的截止频率设置得更高，进而实现更紧致的调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:28
#: 7f5ac29b6e6842fea9331520517e7ed2
msgid "Notch Filter Setup Overview"
msgstr "陷波滤波器设置概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:30
#: 83f40bb2f9054aeea97f3397deb3e061
msgid ""
"Select how the notch center frequency will be controlled. See "
":ref:`center_freq_control`."
msgstr "选择陷波中心频率的控制方式。请参阅 :ref:`center_freq_control`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:31
#: 997c5102863d4c32bc54a63134e8b765
msgid ""
"If a static notch (not usually recommended), or :ref:`throttle-based<common-"
"imu-notch-filtering-throttle-based-setup>` control is used, the dominant "
"noise frequencies will need to be determined in order to setup the notch. "
"See :ref:`notch_center_freq`."
msgstr ""
"如果使用静态陷波（通常不推荐），或 :ref:`基于油门<common-imu-notch-filtering-throttle-based-"
"setup>` 的控制方式，则需要先确定主要噪声频率，才能正确设置陷波。请参阅 :ref:`notch_center_freq`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:32
#: 147695d9b42041cdb6d0ca5d24fb9853
msgid ":ref:`Enable the notch filter<notch_enable>`."
msgstr ":ref:`启用陷波滤波器<notch_enable>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:33
#: 62d75d481cc144c7bd3eae9368869e7a
msgid ""
"Setup the selected center frequency control method using "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>`. Then setup its associated parameters"
" by reading its associated page linked in this secion "
":ref:`center_freq_control`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` 设置所选中心频率控制方式，然后阅读本节 "
":ref:`center_freq_control` 中关联页面，配置其相应参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:34
#: 38a143823cb049e096e6df82b9074555
msgid ""
"After a test flight and log analysis with the notch enabled (See "
":ref:`notch_check`), the :ref:`number and placement of higher harmonic "
"filters implemented can be adjusted <notch_harmonics>`, the use of the "
":ref:`multi-notch options<notch_options>`, or even a second harmonic notch "
"set (:ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>`) can be configured to improve"
" noise reduction effectiveness. The web based `Filter Review Tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__ can be used"
" to experiment with parameter changes based on the test flight log to "
"determine best configurations without having to make iterative test flights."
msgstr ""
"在启用陷波滤波器进行测试飞行和日志分析后（参阅 :ref:`notch_check`），可以调整 "
":ref:`高次谐波滤波器的数量和位置<notch_harmonics>`、使用 "
":ref:`多陷波选项<notch_options>`，或配置第二组谐波陷波（:ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>`）以进一步提升降噪效果。网页版"
" `滤波器审查工具 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__ "
"可根据测试飞行日志模拟参数变化的效果，无需进行迭代测试飞行即可确定最佳配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:40
#: 165bba8eb43740a6bb6a53bbe3ff6b2d
msgid "Enabling the Notch Filters"
msgstr "启用陷波滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:42
#: 52c735f35c0a432dbe468076e0f01074
msgid ""
"The harmonic notch is enabled overall by setting "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE<INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` = 1 for the first notch, and, if "
"needed,  a second set of harmonic notches using "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` = 1. After rebooting, all the "
"relevant parameters will appear."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE<INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` 设置为 1 可启用第一组谐波陷波；如需第二组谐波陷波，将 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` 设置为 1。重启后，所有相关参数将显示出来。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:44
#: fe338faed00449769a869c4497a013c8
msgid ""
"Various methods of dynamically adjusting the notch(s) center frequency to "
"track motor speed under different thrust conditions is provided, ie Dynamic "
"Harmonic Notch filtering."
msgstr "系统提供多种动态调整陷波中心频率的方法，以在不同推力条件下追踪电机转速，即动态谐波陷波滤波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:50
#: 8c7c182377d14d10a41ba1a57d10dcc9
msgid "Notch Filter Control Types"
msgstr "陷波滤波器控制类型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:52
#: 20adb81d4141462db91184b68b8fa8bc
msgid ""
"Key to the dynamic notch filter operation is control of its center "
"frequency. There are five methods that can be used for doing this:"
msgstr "动态陷波滤波器运行的关键在于其中心频率的控制。目前提供五种控制方式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:54
#: f7ad368d2d344c48a37c9da0baf6e1f9
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 0. **Static center frequency**. "
"Dynamic notch frequency control is disabled. The center frequency is fixed "
"and is static. Often used in Traditional Helicopters with external governors"
" for rotor speed, either incorporated in the ESC or separate for ICE motors."
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = "
"0。**静态中心频率**。动态陷波频率控制禁用，中心频率固定不变。通常用于使用外部调速器的传统直升机（调速器可集成于 ESC 或单独用于 ICE "
"发动机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:55
#: c1ef47b06d0a4b179290708ad6f12045
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 1. (Default) **Throttle position "
"based**, where the frequency at hover throttle is determined by analysis of "
"logs, and then variation of throttle position above this is used to track "
"the increase in noise frequency. See :ref:`throttle-based<common-imu-notch-"
"filtering-throttle-based-setup>` for further setup details."
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 1。（默认） "
"**基于油门位置**：在悬停油门下的频率由日志分析确定，之后利用油门位置高于该值的变化来追踪噪声频率的增加。详见 :ref:`基于油门<common-"
"imu-notch-filtering-throttle-based-setup>` 的进一步设置说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:56
#: e631d45dd52d4a3fa62d37a7015ccbb3
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 2 (RPM Sensor 1) or 5(RPM Sensor2)."
" **RPM sensor based**, where an external :ref:`RPM sensor <common-rpm>` is "
"used to determine the motor frequency and hence primary vibration source's "
"frequency for the notch. Often used in Traditional Helicopters (See "
":ref:`Helicopters<common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup>`) using the "
"ArduPilot Head Speed Governor feature. See :ref:`RPM Sensor<common-rpm-"
"based-notch>` for further setup instructions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 2（RPM 传感器 1）或 5（RPM 传感器 2）。**基于 RPM"
" 传感器**：使用外部 :ref:`RPM 传感器 <common-rpm>` 确定电机频率及主要震动源的频率，作为陷波中心频率。通常用于使用 "
"ArduPilot 头部转速调速器功能的传统直升机（参阅 :ref:`直升机<common-imu-notch-filtering-"
"helicopter-setup>`）。详见 :ref:`RPM 传感器<common-rpm-based-notch>` 的进一步设置说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:57
#: 11b76d9df0a54576973707dc8f1ecf54
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 3. **ESC Telemetry based**, where "
"the ESC provides motor RPM information which is used to set the center "
"frequency. This can also be used for the forward motor in fixed wing flight,"
" if the forward motor(s) ESCs report RPM. This requires that your ESCs are "
"configured correctly to support BLHeli telemetry via :ref:`a serial "
"port<blheli32-esc-telemetry>`. See :ref:`ESC Telemetry<common-esc-telem-"
"based-notch>` for further setup instructions. If "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>`, or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` if the second set of notches is "
"enabled, has bit 1 set, then a set of notches for each motor will be "
"created, tracking its RPM telemetry, otherwise, the average frequency of all"
" motors will set the center frequency."
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 3。**基于 ESC 数传**：ESC 提供电机 RPM "
"信息，用于设置中心频率。如果固定翼飞行时前向电机的 ESC 上报 RPM，也可用于固定翼前向电机。此方式要求 ESC 正确配置以通过 "
":ref:`串口<blheli32-esc-telemetry>` 支持 BLHeli 数传。详见 :ref:`ESC 数传<common-esc-"
"telem-based-notch>` 的进一步设置说明。若 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` "
"（或启用第二组陷波时的 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>`）的第 1 "
"位已置位，则会为每个电机创建一组陷波，分别追踪其 RPM 数传；否则，所有电机的平均频率将设为中心频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:58
#: ad813836f2e24118b4b70a4075da256a
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 4. **In-Flight FFT based**, where a"
" running FFT is done in flight to determine the primary noise frequency and "
"adjust the notch's center frequency to match. This probably the best mode if"
" the autopilot is capable of running this feature. It requires that the "
"autopilot firmware supports it (see :ref:`common-limited_firmware` for "
"GyroFFT feature) and has sufficient cpu power (F7/H7 autopilots). See "
":ref:`In-Flight FFT <common-imu-fft>` for further setup instructions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 4。**基于飞行中 FFT**：在飞行中持续运行 FFT "
"以确定主要噪声频率，并动态调整陷波中心频率以匹配。如果飞控具备运行此功能的能力，这可能是最佳模式。它需要飞控固件支持此功能（参阅 "
":ref:`common-limited_firmware` 了解 GyroFFT 特性），并具有足够的 CPU 算力（F7/H7 飞控）。详见 "
":ref:`飞行中 FFT <common-imu-fft>` 的进一步设置说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:60
#: 777fb155be5646c492553570a851823d
msgid ""
"All of the above are repeated, independently, for the second notch and are "
"prefaced with ``INS_HNTC2_`` instead of ``INS_HNTCH_``. The following will "
"explain setup for the first set of notches."
msgstr ""
"上述所有设置对第二组陷波同样适用，只是参数前缀由 ``INS_HNTCH_`` 改为 ``INS_HNTC2_``。以下内容将介绍第一组陷波的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:62
#: 09aef0e54a90421abf567012ad64688b
msgid "only one filter can be mode 4(FFT)."
msgstr "只有一个滤波器可以使用模式 4（FFT）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:68
#: 28f11a93eadc4f60ae6bfa1a3cb3a1f7
msgid "Determining Notch Filter Center Frequency"
msgstr "确定陷波滤波器中心频率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:70
#: 86c251d295fb426ebbd703d94e9cb4e2
msgid ""
"Before actually setting up a dynamic notch filter, the frequencies that are "
"desired to be rejected must first be determined. This is crucial if a static"
" notch or :ref:`common-throttle-based-notch` is used. While the other "
"methods do not require this knowledge before setting up their parameters, it"
" can still be worthwhile as a comparison point for the post filter "
"activation analysis of the filter's effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"在实际设置动态陷波滤波器之前，必须先确定需要抑制的频率。对于静态陷波或 :ref:`common-throttle-based-"
"notch`，这一步至关重要。虽然其他方式在设置参数前不需要此信息，但将其作为滤波器启用后效果分析的对比参考点仍然有价值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:72
#: 99935b4e03ec41ceaa12d224e9054eb0
msgid ""
"Once the noise frequency is determined, the notch filter(s) can be further "
"setup. Historically, :ref:`common-imu-batchsampling` has been used for this "
"(also for slow cpu's like F4-based autopilots), logging short bursts of raw "
"IMU data for spectral analysis."
msgstr ""
"确定噪声频率后，可以进一步设置陷波滤波器。历史上，:ref:`common-imu-batchsampling` 一直用于此目的（也适用于基于 F4 "
"的飞控等 CPU 性能较低的场合），通过记录短暂的原始 IMU 数据进行频谱分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:74
#: ddd06e052dd94335858b3aa502ceba5a
msgid ""
"As of firmware version 4.5 and later, a better method has been developed "
"using continuous raw IMU data, if the autopilot is H7-based, and using a new"
" web based tool. :ref:`This method is now preferred <common-raw-imu-"
"logging>`."
msgstr ""
"自固件 4.5 及更高版本起，针对基于 H7 的飞控，已开发出一种使用连续原始 IMU "
"数据的更优方法，并配合新的网页工具使用。:ref:`目前推荐使用此方法 <common-raw-imu-logging>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:76
#: ef3df40a154d4c55b233c8f16d9bd8ca
msgid ""
"if you see two noise peaks close together, it may be that your copter has "
"significant yaw imbalance. See the :ref:`Yaw Imbalance section "
"<copter:yaw_imbalance>`."
msgstr ""
"如果发现两个相近的噪声峰值，可能是飞行器存在明显的偏航不平衡。请参阅 :ref:`偏航不平衡章节 <copter:yaw_imbalance>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:82
#: 651637a2f14b48dbac5a38c26f2ab582
msgid "Number of Harmonics Filtered"
msgstr "谐波滤波数量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:84
#: 4bf5881f6c404c1998226dab3870de6a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` to enable multiple harmonic "
"filters centered at up to 16x the base frequency (multiples of the center "
"frequency) notches. For ESC :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` tracking,"
" each motor will get a set of these notches. If an octocopter sets up three "
"harmonics, this results in 8 x 3 = 24 notch filters. Enabling triple notches"
" (see below) would result in 72 filters! This would most certainly cause "
"excessive cpu loading and performance issues. Other modes only provide a "
"single set of harmonic notches."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` 可启用最多以基频 16 倍为中心的多组谐波陷波滤波器。对于 "
"ESC :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` "
"跟踪模式，每个电机都会获得一组陷波。如果八旋翼设置了三个谐波，则产生 8 × 3 = 24 个陷波滤波器。启用三重陷波（见下文）将产生 72 "
"个滤波器！这几乎必然导致 CPU 过载和性能问题。其他模式仅提供单组谐波陷波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:86
#: 327b8d8fabdb403cad098d3eaaf6a78b
msgid ""
"Always enable only the number of harmonic notch filters actually required "
"and be especially aware of what is being enabled if using ESC "
"(:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 3) tracking mode. Enabling too "
"many will result in running out of CPU cycles with unpredictable results. "
"Three harmonics is usually safe."
msgstr ""
"始终仅启用实际需要的谐波陷波滤波器数量，尤其是在使用 ESC（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = "
"3）跟踪模式时要特别注意。启用过多将导致 CPU 资源耗尽，产生不可预测的后果。通常三个谐波是安全的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:92
#: 08f7409ac85b46f591537207cc8019df
msgid "Checking Notch Filter Effectiveness"
msgstr "检验陷波滤波器效果"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:94
#: 1d940e403f7943b38cf97b1682b012d3
msgid ""
"Once the notch filter(s) are setup, the effectiveness of them can be checked"
" by again measuring the  frequency spectrum of the output of the filters "
"(which are the new inputs to the IMU sensors). Refer back to the "
":ref:`common-imu-batchsampling`  or :ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` page for "
"this."
msgstr ""
"设置好陷波滤波器后，可以通过再次测量滤波器输出端的频谱（即 IMU 传感器的新输入）来验证其效果。请参阅 :ref:`common-imu-"
"batchsampling` 或 :ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:100
#: a3fe7f72e5c8414db8ac91d09df0951d
msgid "Multi Notch"
msgstr "多重陷波"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:102
#: 05da034d6d674aefbfe3cf320f6e76c4
msgid ""
"The software notch filters used are very \"spikey\" being relatively narrow "
"but good at attenuation at their center. On larger copters the noise profile"
" of the motors is quite dirty covering a broader range of frequencies than "
"can be covered by a single notch filter. In order to address this situation "
"it is possible to configure the harmonic notches as multiple notches that "
"gives a wider spread of significant attenuation. The configuration is "
"controlled by the :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS <INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` parameter. This is "
"a bitmask parameter and multiple options are possible at the same time, but "
"using bit 0, 1, and bit 4 at the same time should be avoided. Use only one "
"of those in a given configuration."
msgstr ""
"所使用的软件陷波滤波器非常「尖锐」，频带较窄，但在中心频率处的衰减效果很好。在较大型飞行器上，电机的噪声分布较为分散，覆盖的频率范围超出了单个陷波滤波器的能力。为解决这一问题，可将谐波陷波配置为多个陷波，从而提供更宽范围的有效衰减。配置由"
" :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS <INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 参数控制。这是一个位掩码参数，可同时选择多个选项，但不应同时使用第 0 "
"位、第 1 位和第 4 位。在特定配置中只能使用其中一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:105
#: 0bed620fddce4154a286d63ffcc3a193
msgid ":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS <INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` Bit"
msgstr ":ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS <INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 位"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:105
#: 906c2a52d5b344bd8c37c0044cdf77d1
msgid "Action"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:107
#: 0a3799eac22544e5b6c3e12f64125a6b
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:107
#: 3184154b8b424920a207b49f659e0aed
msgid "Double overlapping Notches"
msgstr "双重叠陷波"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:108
#: 1fe3a1d819924c778066d7e3a939815b
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:108
#: f2b090db5f40444bb2b0ae2023baf302
msgid ""
"MultiSource: if using FFT Mode, the three largest noise sources will have a "
"notch assigned. If ESC Telemetry Mode, then each motor will have a notch "
"assigned at its RPM. If throttle mode, then each motor will have a notch "
"assigned at its throttle input rather than the average overall throttle."
msgstr ""
"多源模式：若使用 FFT 模式，将为三个最大噪声源各分配一个陷波；若使用 ESC 数传模式，则为每个电机按其 RPM "
"分配一个陷波；若使用油门模式，则为每个电机按其油门输入（而非总体平均油门）分配一个陷波。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:109
#: da22810e8a514095a9dc9cd902e0182d
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:109
#: 8dffc94a34c64672b80d5ef1b2796f64
msgid ""
"Updates the filters at the loop rate. This is cpu intensive, but tracks "
"noise variations faster. Only valid if frequency source updates at loop "
"rate, ie Bi-Directional DShot telemetry."
msgstr "以控制循环频率更新滤波器。此选项 CPU 占用较高，但能更快追踪噪声变化。仅在频率来源以控制循环频率更新时有效，即双向 DShot 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:110
#: 9f8be3135b454602b1b47d7507e8572d
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:110
#: 5a467e01dc714dbe8bcb18fd772dfc7b
msgid ""
"Enables notches on every IMU instead of just the primary. This is cpu "
"intensive, but allows better lane switching decisions in noisy situations "
"and for debugging. Not recommended for F4 boards."
msgstr ""
"在每个 IMU 上启用陷波，而不仅仅是主 IMU。此选项 CPU 占用较高，但可在噪声环境下作出更好的通道切换决策，也便于调试。不推荐在 F4 "
"主板上使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:111
#: 30d6308dff5a4664950cf49bfdda922c
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:111
#: c8eec36193b14f35a040e818e081995c
msgid "Triple overlapping Notches"
msgstr "三重叠陷波"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:112
#: 964d66007cf04968ae22c890c63bd006
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:112
#: 7cb6e6b4b0f44a1092b6f8cbc387602c
msgid ""
"If the RPM source fails (Sensor,ESC telem,FFT) the minimum frequency "
"(:ref:`FFT_MINHZ<FFT_MINHZ>`, :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>`, or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>`) will be used for notch center "
"frequency"
msgstr ""
"若 RPM 来源失效（传感器、ESC "
"遥测、FFT），将使用最低频率（:ref:`FFT_MINHZ<FFT_MINHZ>`、:ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>`"
" 或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>`）作为陷波中心频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:115
#: 98ed0e105da946c7bcba427ee015be09
msgid ""
"double notch option is no longer recommended since the triple notch option "
"has been added. With a double notch, the maximum attenuation is either side "
"of the center frequency, so on smaller aircraft with a very pronounced peak "
"their use is usually counter productive."
msgstr "自三重陷波选项引入后，不再推荐使用双重陷波选项。双重陷波的最大衰减在中心频率两侧，对于噪声峰值非常尖锐的小型飞行器，其效果通常适得其反。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering.rst:118
#: ad6d3920edc249c4967b28637b63f93f
msgid ""
"Each notch has some CPU cost so if you configure multiple notches you can "
"end up with many notches on your aircraft. For example, triple single (no "
"harmonics) notches, using ESC telemetry will result in 3 notches per motor "
"or 12 total notches. For example, with F4 cpus this should be acceptable, "
"but enabling a second group of triple notches with "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` or multiple harmonic notches, "
"could cause problems."
msgstr ""
"每个陷波都有一定的 CPU 开销，因此配置多个陷波会在飞行器上产生大量陷波滤波器。例如，使用 ESC 数传的三重单一（无谐波）陷波，将为每个电机产生 3"
" 个陷波，四旋翼共 12 个。对于 F4 CPU "
"来说，这是可接受的；但启用第二组三重陷波（:ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>`）或多个谐波陷波可能会引发问题。"
